    <mj-text padding="20px 20px 10px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <h3 style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">Art &amp; culture</h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-table
  font-family="Arial"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  padding="0px 32px 0px 32px"
  style="width: 100%"
>
  <tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.timeout.com/london/news/tfl-has-updated-its-art-map-for-the-first-time-a-decade-030326" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">Transport for London has updated the Art Map for its Art on the Underground initiative</a>, highlighting permanent artworks across the Underground network. The programme, launched in 2000, brings site-specific artworks into Tube stations to connect art with everyday travel. The map includes commissions installed since 2016 and guides visitors to 26 permanent works across the network.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/world/uk-news/story/uk-ashmolean-museum-sends-back-stolen-16th-century-bronze-idol-to-tamil-nadu-temple-2877303-2026-03-04" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">The Ashmolean Museum has returned a 16th-century bronze idol of Thirumangai Alvar to India</a> after research showed it had been stolen from the Soundararaja Perumal Temple in Tamil Nadu. After an independent researcher identified photographs linking the sculpture to the temple in 2019, the museum worked with the Indian High Commission and authorities to confirm its provenance. Following a formal ceremony in London, the artefact will be sent to India for verification before being restored to the temple.
  </td>
</tr>
</mj-table>
<mj-text padding="20px 20px 10px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <h3 style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">Sports</h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-table
  font-family="Arial"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  padding="0px 32px 0px 32px"
  style="width: 100%"
>
  <tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/live/c9v01njjzjkt" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">England began their 2027 Women’s World Cup qualifying campaign with a dominant victory over Ukraine</a> in Antalya, Turkey. After a frustrating goalless first half, England took control in the second half with braces from Alessia Russo and Georgia Stanway. Jess Park also scored twice to seal a comfortable victory. The match was played in Turkey because Ukraine cannot host games at home due to the ongoing war with Russia.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.mirror.co.uk/sport/football/news/ksi-dagenham--redbridge-arsenal-36810489" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">KSI has become a shareholder and strategic partner in non-league football club Dagenham &amp; Redbridge FC</a>. The investment follows the recent takeover of the club by Happy Fan Group LLC. KSI said he hopes to help rebuild the club and eventually guide it up the football pyramid, aiming for long-term growth and renewed fan excitement. The club currently plays in the sixth tier of English football.
  </td>
</tr>
</mj-table>
